#==============================================================================================
#
#   html_opt_group_element - HTML::HTMLOptGroupElement: <optgroup>
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/HTML/HTMLOptGroupElement.cpp (lines 1-49) and the inline functions of
#       HTMLOptGroupElement.h: construction (which moves the mixin tables to
#       HTMLOptGroupElement's, as C++'s vptrs move), and the insertion and removing steps that
#       run the select element's selectedness setting algorithm.
